# Linear Regression AI Project

This project demonstrates a simple implementation of Linear Regression using Python and scikit-learn.

## Files
- `main.py` – Core Python script to train and evaluate the linear regression model.
- `requirements.txt` – List of dependencies.

## How to Run
1. Clone the repository.
2. Install dependencies: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
3. Run the script: `python main.py`

## Output
- Prints model accuracy (MSE and R² score).
- Displays a plot showing predicted vs actual values.

## Use Case
This algorithm can be embedded into a smart meter system to predict future energy consumption based on past data.

